Expose Checker.getTypeOfPropertyOfType on the unstable API
`getTypeOfPropertyOfType` already exists on the TypeScript 6 checker and internally in the Go checker (`Checker.GetTypeOfPropertyOfType`), but it is not wired through `typescript/unstable`. This PR exports it on the JS API.
It returns the type of a named property, or `undefined` if the property does not exist. This is the type-level counterpart of `getPropertyOfType`.

